    with keypad:\n- key 8: move up\n- key 2: move down\n- key 4: move left\n- key
    6: move right\n- Key 5: move forward\n- Ctrl + Key 5: move backward\n\nRotation:
    Ctrl + key 8, 2, 4, 6\nTool Speed: up/down arrow keys\n"
